<title>USA: Enhance says Bauer joins new product unit.</title>
<headline>Enhance says Bauer joins new product unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enhance Financial Services Group Inc said Tuesday it hired Gilfred Bauer as a senior vice president for marketing in its new products group.</p>
<p>Bauer, 36, was formerly an executive assistant to the chairman of Alexander &amp; Alexander Consulting Group. At Enhance, he will help design and implement marketing plans for new products, the company said.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
